      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:sefirat_haomer">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sefirat_haomer/1"/>Blessed are You, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sefirat_haomer/2"/>our God, King of the universe,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sefirat_haomer/3"/>Who sanctified us with His commandments
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sefirat_haomer/4"/>and commanded us to count the Omer.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sefirat_haomer/5"/>
